<title>CHINA: HK JUNE MERCHANDISE TRADE FIGURES.</title>
<headline>HK JUNE MERCHANDISE TRADE FIGURES.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following figures for merchandise trade (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars and year-on-year percentage change) (*** denotes less than 0.05 percent)</p>
<p>					 June 1997	  May 1997</p>
<p>Re-exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				 36.36 (+14.7)    37.96 (+ 2.4)</p>
<p> U.S.				  22.62 (+12.2)    20.30 (+ 4.4)</p>
<p> Japan				  5.81 (+ 4.7)     5.71 (- 6.7)</p>
<p> Germany				3.60 (- 1.4)     3.58 (-10.4)</p>
<p> U.K.				   3.14 (+10.6)     2.91 (- 3.1)</p>
<p>Domestic exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				  5.34 (+13.1)    5.57 (+ 2.7)</p>
<p> U.S.				   4.77 (+ 7.3)    3.93 (- 5.8)</p>
<p> Japan				  0.95 (+ 2.6)    0.79 (-23.0)</p>
<p> Germany				0.92 (- 4.5)    0.83 (-11.2)</p>
<p> U.K.				   0.83 (- 1.6)    0.78 (-11.3)</p>
<p>Imports from the five main suppliers</p>
<p> China				 48.50 (+ 6.9)    50.57 (+ 3.6)</p>
<p> Japan				 18.74 (+15.5)    17.14 (+ 7.1)</p>
<p> U.S.				  10.24 (- 3.1)    10.68 (- 6.0)</p>
<p> Taiwan				 9.99 (+ 4.3)    10.94 (+ 0.9)</p>
<p> Singapore			    6.67 (- 1.3)     7.47 (+12.3)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
